# =====================================================\n# UTILS PACKAGE - Utility Functions and Helpers\n# =====================================================\n# This package contains helper utilities for the test framework\n#\n# UTILITIES INCLUDED:\n# - driver_factory.py: Creates and configures web drivers (browsers)\n# - waits.py: Custom wait conditions for synchronization\n#\n# WHY SEPARATE UTILITIES?\n# Utilities are shared code that multiple tests may need.\n# By keeping them separate:\n# - Code is reusable across different tests\n# - Utilities are easy to maintain and update\n# - Tests focus on test logic, not setup details\n
